WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:09.060
The kids had to go to the dentist.

2
00:00:09.061 --> 00:00:12.734
But Oliver wouldn't get in the car.

3
00:00:12.735 --> 00:00:19.943
"I don't want to go!" yelled Oliver.

4
00:00:19.944 --> 00:00:24.253
"It's just a checkup," said Mom.

5
00:00:24.254 --> 00:00:29.089
"The dentist won't hurt you," said Harry.

6
00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:35.279
"I don't like the dentist!" yelled Oliver.

7
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:39.589
"She'll just clean your teeth," said Dad.

8
00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:44.714
"Her chair goes up and down," said Emmy.

9
00:00:44.715 --> 00:00:48.469
Oliver still wouldn't move.

10
00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:52.443
Emmy frowned.

11
00:00:52.444 --> 00:01:00.765
They were going to be late.

12
00:01:00.766 --> 00:01:05.336
"I know what to do," said Emmy.

13
00:01:05.337 --> 00:01:12.928
She ran inside to get something.

14
00:01:12.929 --> 00:01:15.458
"Here, Oliver," she said.

15
00:01:15.459 --> 00:01:19.196
"Your teddy bear likes the dentist.

16
00:01:19.197 --> 00:01:27.870
Why don't you take him with you?"

17
00:01:27.871 --> 00:01:36.080
"Oh . . . ," said Oliver.

18
00:01:36.081 --> 00:01:48.273
"Okay. Let's go!"

19
00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:55.990
Oliver had the first appointment.

20
00:01:55.991 --> 00:02:02.681
"Your teeth look great, Oliver," said Dr. Cool.

21
00:02:02.682 --> 00:02:08.806
"Thanks for the new toothbrush," said Oliver.

22
00:02:08.807 --> 00:02:21.200
Next it was Harry's turn.

23
00:02:21.201 --> 00:02:27.054
"Your teeth look great too, Harry," said Dr. Cool.

24
00:02:27.055 --> 00:02:30.216
"Now it's my turn," said Emmy.

25
00:02:30.217 --> 00:02:42.406
"My teeth always look great."

26
00:02:42.407 --> 00:02:51.671
"Hmm . . . I see a little cavity," said Dr. Cool.

27
00:02:51.672 --> 00:02:55.660
"A cavity?" said Emmy.

28
00:02:55.661 --> 00:02:59.372
"Yes," said Dr. Cool.

29
00:02:59.373 --> 00:03:07.119
"You'll have to come back for a filling."

30
00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:13.340
"I don't want to go to the dentist!" yelled Emmy.

31
00:03:13.341 --> 00:03:18.842
Oliver ran to get something for Emmy.

32
00:03:18.843 --> 00:03:25.355
It was his teddy bear.

